OL,3,GNEWSAFly tippers dump 30 fridges and
OL,4,Afreezers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty fridges and freezers have been
OL,7,Ffly-tipped on land next to Bilston Town
OL,8,FFootball Club's Queen Street Stadium.
OL,10,FCity of Wolverhampton Council's
OL,11,Fenvironmental crime team is
OL,12,Finvestigating, and anyone with
OL,13,Finformation is urged to contact them.
OL,15,FFencing around the site was left
OL,16,Funbolted and the authority said it was
OL,17,Fworking to fix the fence, before
OL,18,Fremoving the white goods.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
