OL,3,GNEWSAFly tippers dump 30 fridges and
OL,4,Afreezers
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Qaiser Azeem, cabinet member
OL,7,Ffor resident services, said: "Fly
OL,8,Ftipping is illegal and the culprits
OL,9,Fshould be utterly ashamed of themselves
OL,10,Ffor their inconsiderate and criminal
OL,11,Fbehaviour."
